# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated frontend assets
# The downloadable CV is built from content/ by tools/cv/build-cv.mjs. Binaries
# that a command reproduces do not belong in the history.
# The content snapshot under src/content-snapshot/ IS committed: it is a build
# input the TypeScript compiler imports, so a fresh clone must be able to build,
# and being JSON it shows content changes as a readable diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/frontend/portfolio-web/public/cv/
